"Position of the watch.\n"
"\n"
"Real time: applied to\n"
"the next snapshot.\n"
"Snapshot: changes the\n"
"position of this one.\n"
"\n"
"Shown in the tab title\n"
"and saved with the\n"
"snapshot."
